   "quote": "$15.00 - Registration fee for passenger and leased vehicles. ... .50 - Emergency Medical System ... $2.00 - Department of Motor Vehicles Cash Fund ... $1.50 - State Recreation Road Fund ... $1.50 - County General Fund ... $4.10 - Plate Fee per plate ... $150.00 - An alternative fuel fee"
  },
  "tax-chart": {
   "name": "Nebraska DMV, Motor Vehicle Tax Calculation Table and Motor Vehicle Fee Calculation (60-3,185)",
